{"title":"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 29","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For each positive number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />, let \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/2/41275b2c59093de29c77a100a0a7ff358a5e874f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)=\\frac{\\left(x+\\frac{1}{x}\\right)^6-\\left(x^6+\\frac{1}{x^6}\\right)-2} {\\left(x+\\frac{1}{x}\\right)^3+\\left(x^3+\\frac{1}{x^3}\\right)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -23px\" width=\"257\" height=\"55\" />. \nThe minimum value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/6/c96dd6ec1dc4ad7520fbdc78fcdbec9edd068d0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"37\" height=\"20\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/a/f6a8c0fc8c6a12c4865d60e0cbf12156d55bc292.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }1\\qquad \\textbf{(B) }2\\qquad \\textbf{(C) }3\\qquad \\textbf{(D) }4\\qquad \\textbf{(E) }6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"353\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/8/c183937f32bbc4e2d34ae04e3bf5505143469d2d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = \\left( x + \\frac{1}{x} \\right)^3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"113\" height=\"46\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/0/e6012dfb1b34dea98dfa7ea5b6bb7fd46eb1c3cd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = x^3 + \\frac{1}{x^3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"92\" height=\"37\" />. Then\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/7/e57883257f8d7a4282bf9d4550bdd8d165639a87.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} f(x) &amp;= \\frac{\\left( x + \\frac{1}{x} \\right)^6 - (x^6 + \\frac{1}{x^6}) - 2}{\\left( x + \\frac{1}{x} \\right)^3 + (x^3 + \\frac{1}{x^3})} \\\\ &amp;= \\frac{\\left( x + \\frac{1}{x} \\right)^6 - (x^6 + 2 + \\frac{1}{x^6})}{\\left( x + \\frac{1}{x} \\right)^3 + (x^3 + \\frac{1}{x^3})} \\\\ &amp;= \\frac{\\left( x + \\frac{1}{x} \\right)^6 - (x^3 + \\frac{1}{x^3})^2}{\\left( x + \\frac{1}{x} \\right)^3 + (x^3 + \\frac{1}{x^3})} \\\\ &amp;= \\frac{a^2 - b^2}{a + b}. \\end{align*}\" width=\"255\" height=\"224\" />\n</p><p>By difference of squares,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/d/caddb3e137d14c1a63a702f244442886aba4144b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} f(x) &amp;= \\frac{(a - b)(a + b)}{a + b} \\\\ &amp;= a - b \\\\ &amp;= \\left( x + \\frac{1}{x} \\right)^3 - \\left( x^3 + \\frac{1}{x^3} \\right) \\\\ &amp;= \\left( x^3 + 3x + \\frac{3}{x} + \\frac{1}{x^3} \\right) - \\left( x^3 + \\frac{1}{x^3} \\right) \\\\ &amp;= 3x + \\frac{3}{x} \\\\ &amp;= 3 \\left( x + \\frac{1}{x} \\right). \\end{align*}\" width=\"332\" height=\"261\" />\n</p><p>By the AM-GM inequality,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/c/42caed1e5176a7e4b6b3d91c11a4b01b07fb474c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x + \\frac{1}{x} \\ge 2,\\]\" width=\"83\" height=\"37\" />\nso <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/8/8/b88740380651d45e66438b586cbf28d9db79d50b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x) \\ge 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"68\" height=\"18\" />. Furthermore, when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/3/34310f2f36ed6d724838edb08788ee62acb33386.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/5/7257e137d3e05ce40a19e5a2d984d2da072c6bf1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(1) = 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"69\" height=\"20\" />, so the minimum value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/6/c96dd6ec1dc4ad7520fbdc78fcdbec9edd068d0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"37\" height=\"20\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/b/adb760a2c7143780db481b394ada34e0bb23b3bc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"22\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME\" title=\"1979 AHSME\">1979 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1979 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1979\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1979_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28\" title=\"1979 AHSME Problems/Problem 28\">Problem 28</a></b>\n</td>\n<td wi